{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey</i> is an arcade motorbike racing game that lets you take part in an individual fight for the championship in the top league of a speedway competition. Compete over multiple career seasons and prove that you are the true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Speedway Odyssey</i> players will see their avatar from a top-down view in a 2D setting on a set of varied round and oval tracks. Each track features a unique combination of static fast (or slow) lanes and a distinct shape providing players with a diverse experience. Your competition for each new game start will be a group of randomly generated AI players of varied difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows for up to 4 players to play locally on a single computer. All game modes (single race, single tournament and career) can be played locally, requiring either a keyboard that supports multiple simultaneous key presses or additional controllers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speedway Odyssey players are given the option to set the number of seasons the career will span, ranging from 1 to 20 seasons. At the start of each career, historical rankings are randomly generated, allowing players to ascend a new set each time. Alternatively, with a switch in options, rankings may start empty.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your title and don't let other pretenders take it away from you. Show that you are the true legend of speedway!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447910?t=1753050103","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447910?t=1753050103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447910/7d4eed3c74a3f6d745e5cc243b674607b8377f7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753050103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447910/7d4eed3c74a3f6d745e5cc243b674607b8377f7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753050103","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3772320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey</i> is an arcade motorbike racing game that lets you take part in an individual fight for the championship in the top league of a speedway competition. Compete over multiple career seasons and prove that you are the true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Speedway Odyssey</i> players will see their avatar from a top-down view in a 2D setting on a set of varied round and oval tracks. Each track features a unique combination of static fast (or slow) lanes and a distinct shape providing players with a diverse experience. Your competition for each new game start will be a group of randomly generated AI players of varied difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows for up to 4 players to play locally on a single computer. All game modes (single race, single tournament and career) can be played locally, requiring either a keyboard that supports multiple simultaneous key presses or additional controllers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Speedway Odyssey players are given the option to set the number of seasons the career will span, ranging from 1 to 20 seasons. At the start of each career, historical rankings are randomly generated, allowing players to ascend a new set each time. Alternatively, with a switch in options, rankings may start empty.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your title and don't let other pretenders take it away from you. Show that you are the true legend of speedway!</p>","developers":["ARRGAR Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447910/header.jpg?t=1753050103","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447910/1245962386/94f94a664befdab63b13a364e12afbd9fa3dcfc7/1753027289/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753029339","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447910/1245962386/94f94a664befdab63b13a364e12afbd9fa3dcfc7/1753027289/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753029339","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447910/1245962386/94f94a664befdab63b13a364e12afbd9fa3dcfc7/1753027289/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753029339","id":257171545,"name":"FIHSO Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171545/be3e81427909e080adc036d66467907bbd252723/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753029339"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447910/498476176/f2b1941a55c69ed151406c0bf496bd9ce8f64b7b/1750852105/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749039327","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447910/498476176/f2b1941a55c69ed151406c0bf496bd9ce8f64b7b/1750852105/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749039327","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447910/498476176/f2b1941a55c69ed151406c0bf496bd9ce8f64b7b/1750852105/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749039327","id":257151007,"name":"FIHSO Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151007/23103dd8f0446c84dca6829a50057220892e068e/